# Nearby Shops — Phase 2 Implementation Plan

Thank you for confirming the feature list! We will omit the "Smart Search" AI component and focus heavily on **both Delivery/Cart logistics and User Engagement**.

Below is the technical implementation plan detailing exactly how we will build these 5 massive upgrades into your platform.

## Proposed Changes

---

### 1. Multi-Shop "Mall Cart" & Batch Delivery (Logistics Upgrade)
To allow users to buy from a Grocery Shop and a Pharmacy in the same order, and pay only one optimized delivery fee.

#### Database Changes
* [NEW] Table `batch_orders` (Groups multiple `orders` together for a single delivery partner)
  * `id` (PK)
  * `user_id` (FK)
  * `total_batch_amount`
  * `combined_delivery_fee`
  * `delivery_partner_id`
  * `status`
* [MODIFY] Table `orders`
  * Add `batch_id` (FK to `batch_orders`, nullable)

#### Backend Routes
* [NEW] `POST /api/v1/shops/cart/batch-checkout`
  * Accepts items grouped by multiple `shop_id`s. Calculates the geographic Haversine distance between the shops and the user to generate a single discounted `combined_delivery_fee`.

---

### 2. "LocalSampark Pass" & Hyperlocal Loyalty Coins (Retention)
To lock users into the ecosystem with rewards.

#### Database Changes
* [NEW] Table `loyalty_accounts`
  * `user_id` (PK/FK)
  * `sampark_coins_balance` (Integer)
* [NEW] Table `loyalty_transactions`
  * Tracks earning and burning of coins per order.

#### Backend Routes
* [MODIFY] `POST /api/v1/shops/orders/checkout` (or the new batch checkout)
  * Automatically credit 1% of the order value as Sampark Coins.
  * Add support for `use_coins=true` flag in checkout to deduct from the order total.

---

### 3. "Local Highlights" (Video/Story Reels for Shops)
To increase daily active users through engaging 15-second shop stories.

#### Database Changes
* [MODIFY] Table `stories`
  * Add `shop_id` (FK to `local_shops`, nullable). If set, this story belongs to a shop rather than a regular user.

#### Backend Routes
* [NEW] `GET /api/v1/shops/highlights/feed`
  * Fetches active (non-expired) stories from shops within a 5km radius of the user's location.

---

### 4. Verified Society Reviews & "Ask the Neighborhood" (Trust)
To build hyper-local trust.

#### Database Changes
* [MODIFY] Table `shop_reviews`
  * Add `is_society_verified` (Boolean). Set to true if the reviewer's address/society matches the shop's immediate neighborhood.
* [NEW] Table `shop_qa`
  * `id` (PK)
  * `shop_id` (FK)
  * `user_id` (FK - asker)
  * `question`
  * `answer`
  * `answered_by` (FK - shop owner or verified neighbor)

#### Backend Routes
* [NEW] `POST /api/v1/shops/:id/qa` and `GET /api/v1/shops/:id/qa`

---

### 5. Flash Sales & "Happy Hours" (Conversion)
To allow merchants to clear inventory during slow hours.

#### Database Changes
* [NEW] Table `flash_sales`
  * `id` (PK)
  * `shop_id` (FK)
  * `product_id` (FK)
  * `discount_percentage`
  * `start_time` (Timestamp)
  * `end_time` (Timestamp)

#### Backend Routes
* [NEW] `GET /api/v1/shops/flash-sales/active`
  * Returns all currently active flash sales for nearby shops, pushed to the top carousel of the Shop Directory.

---

